&lt;p&gt;If you are handling customer data, API keys, or internal logs, that's a security risk.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I built DataFlex Studio (&lt;a href="https://dataflexstudio.vercel.app" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://dataflexstudio.vercel.app&lt;/a&gt;) using Next.js and Web Workers.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;How it works:&lt;br&gt;
• Runs 100% inside your browser using background threads.&lt;br&gt;
• Handles recursive unwrapping of deeply nested arrays and objects.&lt;br&gt;
• Zero server uploads—your data never leaves your tab.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I added a 1-click "Load Sample API Payload" button on the page so you can test parsing speed instantly without needing your own JSON file.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I'm looking for feedback on edge cases or memory bottlenecks with large files (10MB+). I also launched a limited $15 Lifetime Pass for early adopters who want ad-free batch processing.&lt;/p&gt;

